# DAG: eta(q) mass-ratio input-warping experiment (see memory
# manifold_correlation_length.md). TRAIN builds the eta-warped checkpoint;
# SCAN is a DAG child (unsmoothed with-K NS at q=0.50/0.60/0.80).
#
# Submit from /scratch/wiay/daniel/heron-dense45 on wiay:
#   condor_submit_dag condor/dag_qwarp.dag
# Monitor: condor_q daniel -all ; tail -f condor/dag_qwarp.dag.dagman.out

JOB TRAIN condor/train_pa_xas_qwarp_eta.sub
JOB SCAN  condor/scan_pa_xas_qwarp_eta.sub

PARENT TRAIN CHILD SCAN

RETRY TRAIN 1
RETRY SCAN 1
